            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ഏകാന്തത — ēkāntata — \"loneliness; solitude\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "നഗരത്തിൽ മുത്തശ്ശിക്ക് ഏകാന്തത തോന്നി. nagarattil muttaśśikkŭ ēkāntata tōnni. In the city, grandmother felt lonely."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Built on ഏകാന്തം, a lonely place, with -ത, which makes a noun of a quality."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
